			"notes": "### Added\n- New structures can now be found throughout The End\n- Two new biomes: `Dusty Wastes` and `Melancho`\n- - New blocks `End Dust` and `End Ice` can be found in Dusty Wastes and Melancho respectively.\n- New tier of material: `Culminite`. A combination of Netherite and Endium that takes the best of both worlds.\n- Two new enchantments: `Reach` and `Stasis`.\n- - Reach 1-3: Gives an extra block of reach for each level. Can be applied to chestplates and elytras.\n- - Stasis: Allows you to levitate in air while flying + crouching. Can be applied to elytras.\n### Changes\n- Rewrote the mod from the ground up\n- Updated to 1.19.4\n- Tweaked Chromium Ore generation\n- Tweaked Lungwort Flower generation\n### Fixes\n- Overall more optimized\n- Crashes from 1.19.2 version\n\n### Mod requirements:\n- [Dawn API](https://modrinth.com/mod/dawn/version/4.2.0)\n- [Reach Entity Attributes](https://maven.jamieswhiteshirt.com/libs-release/com/jamieswhiteshirt/reach-entity-attributes/2.3.2/reach-entity-attributes-2.3.2.jar)"
		},
